Hi Simon,

We have a pull request lined that up that addresses some of the namespace and scoping issues that may be involved.  Would you mind trying after installing this branch:

library(devtools)
install_github("nimble-dev/nimble", ref = "update-where", subdir = "packages/nimble")

I'm not sure if it involves exactly the same issues, but if you don't mind trying and letting us know, that would help.

-Perry

