So I figured out what the issue was. I had a NA matrix in the setup,

q <- matrix(nrow=numnodes,ncol=2)

The sampler fills in the matrix each iteration as part of the calculations. But I guess it caused problems in C++ with the type. So, I just added one row in the setup,

q[1,1:2] <- c(-.99,-.99)

This seemed to fixed it. Is this what you would recommend doing?

